  <item>
    <title>EP9:重生之我在清迈学按摩 清迈旅居一个月</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682f4c29fcbc2e206b458663</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682f4c29fcbc2e206b458663</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 May 2025 18:37:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是2025年3月在清迈旅居的一个月的体验~</span></p><span></span><p><span>准备出一期关于旅居的Q&amp;A，大家有什么好奇的问题欢迎在评论区留言，我会收集起来做一期特别节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a> 租公寓小小踩雷（蓝白公寓Huaykew Residence）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl9eZQGIhVuCvd6BTwoVKY5tbLZJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 清迈最有趣的体验之 上按摩学校</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoHDXgcyDaJMOQwXaCSjyc6-KmBd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 激情安利按摩店！Sum Bamboo Massage和新月水疗中心</span></p><span></span><p><span>个人认为一般的：Let's Relax</span></p><span></span><p><span>避雷的：Viang Ping Massage by Mamrali</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 拜访乌蒙寺 微笑佛</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo46AxOQ6_z5rfTNsVu7Or-Hjxcy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 39号咖啡 &amp;艺术村 &nbsp;吐槽出片文化ing</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjGBpWViFykvWeWnrWQQnKCq4hAl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 古城寺庙 Wat Tong Yu的免费冥想课</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjTjUlss6V8rlnNqF5llUQak2vxl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 清迈国家博物馆 &amp;清迈分手博物馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQt0USq11ghMcpb2Xk5TfHQk7fR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 泰国食物小小介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>冬阴功汤 &nbsp;Pad Thai, Pad See Ew,</span></p><span></span><p><span>泰奶：Charlie Tea</span></p><span></span><p><span>避雷两家米其林：Ginger Farm和Kao Soy Ninnman</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 在清迈购物之发现清迈代购小商机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 清迈集市</span></p><span></span><p><span>最推荐的是周六周日晚上的古城夜市</span></p><span></span><p><span>第二推荐JJ Market：稍微精品一些的衣服饰品集市</span></p><span></span><p><span>提醒大家：去逛市场的话一定要提前搜索一下每个市场的开放时间！以免跑空了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 分享一下本人在夜市买到的冤大头经历</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgsowIZ4mLgM_kJQh1Df8UL-D0i9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 最推荐大家买的伴手礼：猫猫符！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2uMnITk-Zk0L_PBxVsHTHp1CmC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1926">32:06</a> 清迈算命中（此处挖个坑：下次出一期在世界各地算命特辑）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FruNgcHzH1L-asjCQkaM37ONvZkO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 在集市上遇到卖盗版塔罗牌的店！</span></p><span></span><p><span>购买塔罗牌一定要去Maya商场的Asia Book！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 安利一下Maya商场</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shabu自助火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 在泰国看《哪吒2》：电影开始之前要先放国歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 安利两家书店&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【飞地共和国】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【The Lost bookshop】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frq4bxa6gpK9jSKuIvdmInWz0Z_Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 在清迈的三次关于死亡的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一次：买到了一本关于死亡的论文《Confrontations with the Reaper: A philosophical Study of the Nature and Value of Death》</span></p><span></span><p><span>第二次：坐在古城的夜市听到《月亮代表我的心》</span></p><span></span><p><span>第三次：离开清迈当天遭遇地震</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/679e4545405baec4d3ba6412/liF-yA3YtWbFvVjPczxCLHBHxTQ9.m4a" length="56686654" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGLQsitYFZrqw5dBZyctbP53vs0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP8:探秘地球上最像外星的地方之 也门索科特拉岛 内含大踩坑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681321056970cc7b4d3a636b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681321056970cc7b4d3a636b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 May 2025 07:33:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>久违的更新 实在是最近沉迷于听霓达播客所以无心搞自己的节目了嘿嘿嘿</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是2024年4月在索岛度过的8天，有绝美原始自然风光，也有我们整个团15人被无良领队遗弃在索岛的抓马事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a> 索岛在哪里？在亚丁湾！属于也门但阿联酋对此地虎视眈眈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>先来给大家拔拔草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 索岛奇妙植物：沙漠玫瑰、龙血树（树脂为红色）、黄瓜树（极度濒危物种）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1_Nr6Bzr_NHI793BmNEmPuQbKA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>龙血树↑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjtOOoy3ACdCqfa1dvpe0AGY6lu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>沙漠玫瑰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvpofJDqP9umSY2N6uO5Gp5cxhrD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>沙漠玫瑰的花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a> 原地地区如何洗澡？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgN2SdmcSlcjhgzSnyTelRDZutgq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 与世隔绝的小岛能上网吗？可以！用星链starlink</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 索岛吃什么？千万别轻易尝试羊奶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 龙血树森林露营&amp;和土地接触的一些思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 在索岛读什么？《与神对话》《瓦尔登湖》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 在索岛听什么《拉赫玛尼诺夫第二钢琴协奏曲》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 五点起来追海豚！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FogJ4Os6u4G-kkGnqvgGOCNNGPBY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 著名景点之洞穴野人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_CkSf7t049grMKBCvhVUQxeMx-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgfeWKn4GjSRIdO798XadYl1Akg1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>洞穴野人的海景房！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a> 洞穴野人NPC的隐藏剧情之 下海打捞新鲜的海胆给我们吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 索岛首都介绍！岛虽原始 但有商店、学校、医院、餐厅、银行 连大学都有！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgiE8oy6T5fBC7NTZu4gD3zV1XEP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>解锁打卡索岛医院之：穆斯林包扎伤口的话不能用酒精消毒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqgGFC495_272F0BLhABh5Uv1Bjj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQ8v3oahEw0R6S2UPYoOvmljwcB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 索岛可爱的小朋友们~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk97SjEBdMX6EUO55JtOhirfk1fb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 抓马时间大吃瓜之：在索岛遇到无良领队！第一次跟团游就变噩梦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 阿布扎比直飞索岛的机票</span></p><span></span><p><span>领队把阿布扎比念成阿扎布比 坑爹已初见端倪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 6-8人精品小团惨变17人大旅游团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 领队拜托我帮她去换汇……？一位没有visa/mastercard的环球50国旅行达人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 旅行达人竟不知道埃及穆斯林斋月？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 不会用谷歌地图的境外领队！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 自称在英国伦敦留学过但不会说英文的领队！！！连入境信息卡都看不懂的境外领队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 最好的车 只有领队能坐 坏车只给客人罢了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 不会英文的领队 可算把我们坑惨了 不仅不给大家翻译信息，还直接告诉地接说：</span></p><span></span><p><span>这帮中国人不喜欢看风景，不要停车直接开走</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国人风评狠狠被害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 17个人的大团，只有我和另一个女生会说英语。我付费来度假，惨变鲍女士的仆人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 倒霉的开端就是因为轻信了 享某游这家公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a> 被领队指着鼻子破口大骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a> 沙漠黑夜烛光大撕X现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2870">47:50</a> 团友既被当成摄影师苦力 又因为鲍女士的错误信息 丢了一个价值2w的无人机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 好不容易回到国内 开始投诉举报流程&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 塔罗师职业素养之：出发前给自己占卜 本次旅途将会对我的自媒体生涯有所帮助 但没想到是这样的帮助啊！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 关于“主理人带团旅行”——避雷避雷避雷！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 下期预告：评论区听友点菜之：清迈旅居</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/679e4545405baec4d3ba6412/ljXQhmKMjTTGpBv45yu6cbLkGZNY.m4a" length="54815174" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGLQsitYFZrqw5dBZyctbP53vs0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP7:旅居在缅甸蒲甘与曼德勒 文明脆弱不堪一击</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e6e6dd8eecdbeb60ca8f2e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e6e6dd8eecdbeb60ca8f2e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Mar 2025 19:26:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目发布的时候真的很不凑巧，昨天录制完，今天就遇上缅甸突发地震，我立刻给缅甸小哥Zaw发了消息，几个小时之后他回复我他在仰光，目前很安全，只是内战尚在继续，对自己的国家他不知道还能说什么。</span></p><span></span><p><span>看完之后我觉得非常难受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中提到的很多景点，仅仅是一天之内，已经成为遗迹了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 缅甸路上的岗哨检查到底在查什么+缅甸过夜大巴经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 缅甸小哥Zaw</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 蒲甘印象最深的三顿饭</span></p><span></span><p><span>和两个中国人、缅甸小哥吃烤串</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> 旅过这么多地方唯一不敢晚上出门的就是没有路灯的蒲甘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 第二顿饭：茅草棚里的缅甸满汉全席</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 第三顿饭：等落日的时候在茅草棚子里吃天妇罗~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 坐马车游览蒲甘佛塔 40分钟马车需要多少钱呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 缅甸传统之大撒钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 踩雷之蒲甘大皇宫 +蒲甘王朝小历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 特纳卡 缅甸最具特色的自然防晒霜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 绝佳日落观赏地 南明观景台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 看到万塔之国会让我想到在北京的景山公园俯瞰故宫的时候的画面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 打卡蒲甘博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 印象深刻的展品之：13世纪 中文和缅甸文共同书写的石碑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 一些素人留名历史的小技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 印象深刻的展品之：蒲甘佛塔大合集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 摩诃菩提寺 和吴哥窟的须弥山造型非常相像！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 探索杂草丛生中的佛塔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 偶遇暮归的牧羊人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 偶遇缅甸当地带我去爬佛塔的卖画人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2870">47:50</a> 至今也非常后悔自己对那幅画这样砍价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 到达曼德勒！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 体验曼德勒著名青旅 因为停电再次过上自律生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 曼德勒最著名的景点：世界上最大的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 曼德勒大皇宫——贡榜王朝最后的皇宫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3257">54:17</a> 曼德勒大皇宫其实是位于 这也导致参观需要做很多次身份登记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a> 看似严肃但实际上趴在桌子上吸狗的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> 又到了推荐书籍环节——《雨夜雾梦》和《如愿》&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《雨夜雾梦》：“所谓人生，不过是一种看法而已”</span></p><span></span><p><span>《如愿》缅甸乡土文学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3585">59:45</a> 我们对某个国家和地区的印象，究竟是如何被塑造的？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/679e4545405baec4d3ba6412/lqDPq_PGKB0uqajwkdcCCPV8yMsZ.m4a" length="62743125" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGLQsitYFZrqw5dBZyctbP53vs0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP6:我，27岁，独自来到缅甸旅居（内含防电诈指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d9b745dd11f9c8c182dc31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d9b745dd11f9c8c182dc31</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Mar 2025 21:07:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>想你的风还是吹到了缅甸！本期节目带来今年2月在缅甸生活半个月的观察。由于时长原因，蒲甘和曼德勒以及缅甸内战的内容会在下一期继续和大家分享~</span></p><span></span><p><span>wx: linkonghere</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Lin酱环球旅居中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 为什么选择去缅甸旅居？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 选择旅居地就像做投资 我选择旅居的生活方式很大程度上是受到吉姆罗杰斯的《旅行，人生最重要的投资》这本书的启发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 缅甸电诈园区面面观！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> 为什么放心去缅甸？去缅甸旅行，比电诈更可怕的是内战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 王星的女友嘉嘉简直是天神般的女人！有效的求助信息太重要了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> 大部分去园区的人其实都知道自己是去干什么的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 去园区的关键在于：出发前已经被园区的人联系上了！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 园区的人可能存在的几种形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 想去旅游 千万别在网上找搭子！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 很久不联系的亲朋好友其实是重灾区！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 缅甸人都穷凶极恶？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 比起被抓去园区，我们普通人更大的风险是遇到电诈</span></p><span></span><p><span>诈骗套路小小盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 虚拟货币投资诈骗是重灾区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 终于开始说缅甸旅行了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 去之前我对缅甸的印象全部来自于大小S的综艺节目《我们是真正的朋友》在缅甸录制的 可惜缅甸不再是那个安宁的缅甸 大S也斯人已逝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1164">19:24</a> 怎么说服家里人的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 在缅甸和海关的奇葩经历 旅行28国以来第二次给海关小费……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 去唐人街外婆家饺子馆换汇！ 缅甸黑市的汇率和官方汇率差一半哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1365">22:45</a> 缅甸=免电 整个国家处于电力严重不足的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 到蒲甘手机没信号 WiFi用不了本交易员股票账户大出血555</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 停电是彻底治好了我的拖延症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 这样的生活让我意识到 其实人所以要的必需品是很少的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 仰光旅行第一站——英国殖民大楼 &amp; 奥威尔的第一本小说《缅甸岁月》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> “我在仰光很想你”标牌出现了！ 想你的风还是吹到了缅甸！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 在殖民大楼吃肯德基！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1856">30:56</a> 仰光最有名的佛塔：瑞光大金塔和苏雷佛塔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> 在寺庙/石窟/佛塔念经就像参加livehouse</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 缅甸人捐赠水源的习俗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 缅甸所有的佛塔都需要光脚进入 所以最大的风险是——烫！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> 仰光的另一个佛教重地：乔达基卧佛寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2249">37:29</a> 仰光市政厅 差点大摇大摆走进人家政府部门了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 本地人的昂山市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 高档商场junction city!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 以前发达国家的白人来中国 就是这样的感受吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 打卡缅甸国家博物馆——出人意料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 重生之我在缅甸坐火车</span></p><span></span><figure><img></figure><span></span><figure><img></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjBvE5urmJQmnukeNdmNOPDP46Sc.heic"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnpy7p-iXKfm0XXnGZr3P6x324qk.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/679e4545405baec4d3ba6412/llZq1lfohGaftM_qAsXXa41GqnW8.m4a" length="43923585" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGLQsitYFZrqw5dBZyctbP53vs0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP5:免签国中的顶流！格鲁吉亚凭何成为最难忘一站？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cf217d0766616acd04838d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cf217d0766616acd04838d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 19:36:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目和大家分享的是去年在格鲁吉亚旅居一个月的故事~这是我四百多天的旅行经历中最宝贵的一站，希望你听得愉快~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a> 给solo旅行的朋友们的两个实用建议！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 格鲁吉亚物价大揭秘！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 格鲁吉亚本地美食大揭秘+避雷两家中餐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最有名的一道菜：</span><strong><span>Khachapuri</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大笼包：Khinkali</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 格鲁吉亚特产果干：</span><strong><span>Churchkhela</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 不要错过博尔若米气泡水！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 跟着我一起第比利斯citywalk!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 一定要体验的前苏联硬核地铁！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 第比利斯地下印刷厂——斯大林早年活动痕迹+触发神秘NPC剧情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 格鲁吉亚人都很冷漠？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 孤独星球封面！大多数人来格鲁吉亚的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 最孤独的教堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 来卡兹别克住雪山小木屋！绝！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> solo trip保命要点：能坐公共交通一定不要单独包车！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> uplistikhe保护区+哥里一日游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 斯大林出生地：哥里Gori</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 一日游偶遇一位韩国神秘老头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 终于要说到我的格鲁吉亚邻居了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 推荐格鲁吉亚文学作品《梨地》</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加我的vx:linkonghere，加入我的朋友圈，和我一起云游世界~（备注播客）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Lin酱环球旅居中</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/679e4545405baec4d3ba6412/lidI0iqKN3mT-HdRYgV2KtRBIFXT.m4a" length="46763302" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGLQsitYFZrqw5dBZyctbP53vs0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP4:谁会去柬埔寨旅居啊！柬埔寨一个月面面观|吴哥窟|红色高棉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c45455bf52a16cd1000f11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c45455bf52a16cd1000f11</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Mar 2025 13:44:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>27岁，一个人来到柬埔寨待了一个月。本期节目包含首都金边和暹粒两个城市，主要介绍了柬埔寨现在的一些情况+吴哥窟历史，后半段讲了柬埔寨最惨痛的一段历史（红色高棉）可能有些沉重，但我相信旅行中不该只有光鲜亮丽岁月静好的东西。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目推荐的书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《吴哥之美》《吴哥王朝简史》《儿子，你要活下去》</span></p><span></span><p><span>纪录片《莫高窟与吴哥窟的对话》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">0:10</a> 为什么要选择去柬埔寨旅居？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">2:26</a> 关于柬埔寨，唯一大家还能够给到一些正面评价的地方：吴哥窟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">3:40</a> 柬埔寨物价竟然是东南亚除了新加坡最贵的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> &nbsp;吴哥窟你不得不知道的背景知识！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 《吴哥之美》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 《吴哥王朝兴亡史》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 央视纪录片《莫高窟与吴哥窟的对话》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 洞里萨湖日落：最好的奢侈品不过是安静地看一场日落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 画风一转来到柬埔寨的首都金边！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 金边大皇宫与西哈努克</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 琼邑克杀人场和S21集中营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> S21集中营：“做人不能太自由了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> “现在您站的位置是本次导览的起点，也是遇难者生命的重点”</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入我的朋友圈和我一起云游世界：linkonghere</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Lin酱环球旅居中</span></p>]]></description>
