    <itunes:duration>00:54:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGLQsitYFZrqw5dBZyctbP53vs0.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP3:丝绸之路敦煌旅居，看石窟居然听到佛祖对我说话了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b9f000606e5c594029caca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b9f000606e5c594029caca</guid>
